/**
 * The lymphoma roadmap and the open questions, facet C of the lymphoma deep dive. Every dated claim in the steps
 * points at a paper record in the lymphoma-evidence files or in the wider corpus, or at a ClinicalTrials.gov
 * record read on 1 October 2026. The `watch` dates are quoted from the registry as read that day and are not
 * predictions.
 *
 * The roadmap id is `lymphoma-roadmap` rather than the facet prefix because that is the id a reader would guess
 * and the pattern every other deep dive follows (colorectal-roadmap, prostate-roadmap). The ideas carry the
 * facet prefix.
 */
type R = Omit<RoadmapInput, "kind" | "asOf">;
