    name: "Report the time from apheresis to infusion as a trial endpoint, not a logistics footnote",
    aka: ["Vein-to-vein time as a CAR-T endpoint", "Manufacturing interval in cell therapy trials"],
    tldr: "The best explanation for why one second-line CAR-T trial failed when two succeeded is how long the cells took to make. That interval is almost never a reported endpoint.",
